# Every variable the app reads must be listed here (names only, never values).
# `npm run check:factory` fails when code reads a variable that is missing from this file.
# Server secrets have no prefix. Values the browser may see start with NEXT_PUBLIC_.

# Optional: run the browser tests against a deployed URL instead of a local build.
# E2E_BASE_URL=https://example.com

# Optional: path to a Chromium binary for the browser tests, when the version
# Playwright expects is not installed (common in cloud agent sessions).
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_PATH=/opt/pw-browsers/chromium
